Invoked but not redistributed
-----------------------------

SYBA (https://github.com/lich-uct/syba) is licensed under GPL-3.0. Its source is
NOT included in this repository: it is installed from its own upstream
distribution into a separate conda environment and invoked as a separate
program, so no GPL-licensed code is combined with or redistributed by this
project. Only its license text is kept, at scripts/tools/syba/LICENSE.txt, for
reference. SYBA's ~115 MB fragment-score table is likewise obtained from the
upstream conda package rather than from here; see README section 2.

Data
----

The dummy CSVs under data/ are fabricated scores over public molecules, included
so the pipeline can be run end to end without restricted inputs. The annotation
records underlying the published analyses are not part of this repository.
